TrueLine includes MobileSAM, exported to ONNX for local inference.
MobileSAM: https://github.com/ChaoningZhang/MobileSAM
Authors: Chaoning Zhang and the MobileSAM contributors.
License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).
The model includes the Segment Anything architecture and weights from Meta
Platforms, Inc. and affiliates, and the TinyViT architecture from Microsoft.
No part-specific fine-tuning has been performed. Images remain on the device.
The upstream checkpoint checksum and exported model checksums are recorded
in manifest.json. ONNX Runtime Web is distributed under the MIT License;
its notice is in js/vendor/onnx/LICENSE.
